      "text": "Events",
      "sha256": "8d14f6e72de8f18ab1ee5c5330f00653c0c3ce099e63024454f80af97e72d333"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "b96884e90ac6119d68cf20e3",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "8",
      "locator": "paragraph 8",
      "text": "Donate",
      "sha256": "c91ee0f2799df915efcc117ba063d95e0cbf0d5e8e6eca5373333bb9b06c5f13"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "e57ac0c0e39bbdefa5c3cbe5",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "9",
      "locator": "paragraph 9",
      "text": "OUR PLATFORM",
      "sha256": "07e4b1ab6cb6b0164f683d4baab90f7d9d555ce6d9eb32ae1ae1f5506ea710a0"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "7bf9d859e7ee21ba696998ba",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "10",
      "locator": "paragraph 10",
      "text": "Aprile Hearn has been involved with community engagement and public service for over two decades in district 5. She lives, works, worships, and raised her family within the district. As a democratic socialist, Aprile is dedicated to fighting for the working class and the unseen in our community.",
      "sha256": "a54992faf0e007c57d60390e708e2b2a5dd1d3b94de997270a62afb6c71742af"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "ace0bd5b1457cea7ddf6655e",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "11",
      "locator": "paragraph 11",
      "text": "Together with the residents of district 5, Aprile will lead the community to reduce harm, improve the health of our neighborhoods, and elevate quality of life for working class people. Aprile has learned through personal experience what it takes to find solutions, navigate roadblocks, and get things done.",
      "sha256": "9607bed026442ce5ee31af367d04768aa1ad0c170e176a33312ae8505d994eee"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "d401a7348bc46e5ac2884840",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "12",
      "locator": "paragraph 12",
      "text": "A VOTE FOR DEMOCRACY IN OUR LIVES",
      "sha256": "eb6738eff813906e77b960b067403dccebcc111d73aca22ee573d005d04dd9a7"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "bca585109cbf0c3e526d2a5d",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "13",
      "locator": "paragraph 13",
      "text": "Create an advisory council for district 5 so that the people can decide on discretionary spending",
      "sha256": "231396c9f5139fb9d7f249dbbf4c9ec286bd0ba03cabfe774e3f3122ad99ab51"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "66dfaf60391945e7d1c74f86",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "14",
      "locator": "paragraph 14",
      "text": "Public input on the city budget through town halls",
      "sha256": "5f32d52df6bc2b2b0f2b35c9cda118a4a114894933643679649c46161b37372a"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "1250f49c05c7da5a59af3ab1",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "15",
      "locator": "paragraph 15",
      "text": "End corporate giveaways to developers of our land and taxpayer dollars",
      "sha256": "4c40384746e064a5c659399df4c9b49d82854d1972c3e3649242897a44a5bbef"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "03d01e3952b8f8ed8d41241e",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "16",
      "locator": "paragraph 16",
      "text": "Fully fund TARC through a ballot referendum for free buses and expanded services",
      "sha256": "2e021fef68834dc1695908737366e45ca582bc28a30c61474009f1b655fa9ff7"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "421144773b1c92ff9b29bed1",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "17",
      "locator": "paragraph 17",
      "text": "A STRONGER LOUISVILLE",
      "sha256": "b09fa62241955aac55d51c99b224d2e7a7a5a766a31af0707492f7d17028fd31"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "87d9781618431a28c2cfe9f4",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "18",
      "locator": "paragraph 18",
      "text": "Support community centered-and-run programs that keep kids in school and off the streets and address the root cause of violence",
      "sha256": "f82766e95a3b84e58b1a448e6a25f6fb79958d766bf8b501ed8aaaa773366e66"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "e285b38e636e809c82b3dc73",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "19",
      "locator": "paragraph 19",
      "text": "Invest in public spaces and resources like parks, libraries, community healthcare and affordable housing that’s actually affordable",
      "sha256": "d843a946fd817d9edf11a0f64c556b5f6815dd6bdecb5ea0b4bf4a1e9150028a"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "082a9976db277c5197606a04",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "20",
      "locator": "paragraph 20",
      "text": "Stand up to Trump and Frankfort Republicans telling us how to run our city",
      "sha256": "27291e186b76b8b7561598610f72a8a4dda66282e2c72abdc071d27be4c2070b"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "bb6c8227f8ddac4c879f5428",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "21",
      "locator": "paragraph 21",
      "text": "Fight for solutions to homelessness that get people off the streets",
      "sha256": "40dc6e936036dbef36f1e9b87f6cf65ae208e6cfc8ae78b63aaca8b54d58a732"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "94b6571f6b537a9228702423",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "22",
      "locator": "paragraph 22",
      "text": "A HEALTHIER WEST END",
      "sha256": "5b94f4f9095822a780a00aea84fd0a9673453ff99be43f1df06ddd812e105746"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "0d1446a9a2838c7467eca855",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "23",
      "locator": "paragraph 23",
      "text": "Bring LG&E into public ownership",
      "sha256": "b3ea16294691346e50fca82287d263386fc3f1850af9d485ad7d7de1dcb777e4"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "5e20a17026a1cbda426dfc0b",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "24",
      "locator": "paragraph 24",
      "text": "Stop hyperscale data centers being built in our communities",
      "sha256": "137c4653a7b1ee5f28dc4173e90453cfb90522b3946d6d753d05fb26d3239c3a"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "27a2ce78a90bffe15adfccee",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "25",
      "locator": "paragraph 25",
      "text": "End food deserts with city-run grocery stores for healthy food",
      "sha256": "047c1c57845b03c5826d1132a4901d441b8ff61e8719b8d75ad3a2f632c9cf72"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "c85e76b890fa3f2380964e55",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "26",
      "locator": "paragraph 26",
      "text": "Provide green spaces for horticultural projects",
      "sha256": "51638dad1dd9463a9e4426575e118524bda3f754bedc4eeed940dfcfc2247097"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "b9dfbc37d1172fd96d0d1591",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "27",
      "locator": "paragraph 27",
      "text": "Protect our children by reinstating protections against lead poisoning removed by Metro Council in 2025—a removal our current representative voted for",
      "sha256": "b7230d15efa57f2c791390138fb903cf5a84784064b22009058d270297f09c1e"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "37a532cfa1ca26632d9797fa",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "28",
      "locator": "paragraph 28",
      "text": "©2026 Paid for by the",
      "sha256": "a61518fa1374229ed967ba276d6e5c8719aacacf55054c31bd7721ce1f2228b5"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "32a3226fb1a4957220d17496",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "29",
      "locator": "paragraph 29",
      "text": "Campaign to Elect Aprile Hearn for",
      "sha256": "9522740313c1087b86a690ed40849b61bb02eb110277e9c8edcd4bf9f5f34d46"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "ffdc563d96ff771524d836fd",
      "document_id": "replacement-hearn-archive",
      "segment_kind": "paragraph",
      "index": "30",
      "locator": "paragraph 30",
      "text": "Louisville Metro Council District 5",
      "sha256": "31c3227c25d8084c712f13bb6361b64d41cc7b3be23cad8e429ac7fae7308756"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "a2d2482d003c4dbaeb3a44c6",
